scuttlebot — provenance

This repository is a release snapshot of "scuttlebot", a forecasting bot
built for Metaculus's Summer 2026 FutureEval bot tournament (project 33022).

Source
------
Frozen from the private development repository at commit 2a778ac (2026-07-20).
That revision is the configuration that produced the majority of the
season's forecasts: a cross-model ensemble (gpt-5.5, claude-opus-4-8,
gemini-3.5-flash) over criteria-planned research (Exa + AskNews), with
tail-humility post-processing and prediction-market anchoring. The
financial-series quant path and the coverage alarm are included.

History
-------
The private repository's commit history is intentionally not included; this
release was squashed to a single commit. Development, operations notes, and
internal planning documents have been removed for publication.
